cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Bifacial Photovoltaic generation dataset at a high
  latitude location.
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Edoardo
    family-names: Scalera
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0007-8759-5666'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/EdoardoScalera/PVdata-K4'
abstract: >-
  A Nordic off-grid bifacial photovoltaic (BPV) open data
  collection system, located at a high-latitude site (60°N)
  in Otaniemi, Espoo, Finland. The dataset includes PV data
  from the charge controller, front and rear plane-of-array
  irradiance, module temperatures and meteorological
  variables collected from a local weather station. 
keywords:
  - Bifacial PV
  - Solar energy
  - Photovoltaic
  - High latitude
  - Nordic countries

